7	# Step 3: Deploy the MCP Server
8	
9	3.1 Follow the optimal deployment option to perform the deployment. During the deployment process, strictly adhere to the requirements outlined in the "Deployment Guidelines".
10	
11	3.2 If the deployment is successful, proceed to Step 4; if it fails, terminate the task and strictly output "❌ @@Task Failed@@".
